						 <blockquote> <p>&quot;dogs which their scurvy is most serious?&quot;</p> </blockquote> <p>Yes, though in this case, &quot;dogs&quot; refers to crew members. The entire article is written in slang to mimic the way that old-fashioned pirates (mostly in movies) talk.</p> 
