					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-392629#post-3809750</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-392629/scp-808-j#post-3809750</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 23 May 2018 06:58:05 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Zyn</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1404533</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>an explanation of why the procedure of this article requires to &quot;bring many fruits aboard ta be savin' even their scurviest of dogs&quot;</p> </blockquote> <p>Scurvy refers to a vitamin deficiency disease that sailors often got. It was thought to be cured/prevented with fruits like lemons (I think because of the Vitamin C). Proper nourishment prevents scurvy. It's part of the containment procedures because the joke is about pirates.</p> <blockquote> <p>Is this a typo of &quot;scurvies&quot;?</p> </blockquote> <p>I think it's a word meaning &quot;most scurvy&quot;, in the same way that &quot;prettiest&quot; means &quot;most pretty&quot;.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
